        <mxCell id="entry" value="&lt;b&gt;Application boundary + BaseAgent&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;agents/interface/; agents/agents/base/agent.py&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Public operations, run admission and records. Concrete providers implement the native execution hooks." style="shape=rectangle;rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=10;fillColor=#EAF0FA;strokeColor=#8193A5;fontColor=#20384A;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="col_0">
